    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" and \"resting\"... it sounds so peaceful when you say it like that. But it feels so final. Like, if I truly stop trying, if I just let everything go, there isn't really a way to come back from that, is there? It feels like the only way to actually get that quiet is to just... exit. To just stop everything.",
